WEBVTT

00:06.210 --> 00:09.420
<b>Looks like you two were really going at it... yet again.</b>

00:11.380 --> 00:15.040
<b>So? Was it Kaguya who out-debated you this time?</b>

00:16.540 --> 00:17.960
<b>I just can't accept it.</b>

00:18.880 --> 00:21.670
<b>Even assuming that what Kaguya says is right.</b>

00:22.710 --> 00:25.330
<b>Acting like sacrifices are a foregone conclusion is wrong.</b>

00:32.290 --> 00:34.080
<b>Just simmer down, Lion.</b>

00:41.580 --> 00:43.750
<b>So, Alise. What's your take on it?</b>

00:44.330 --> 00:46.710
<b>I'm partial to your way of thinking, Lion.</b>

00:47.000 --> 00:50.170
<b>Making sure everyone survives.
What could be a happier ending than that?</b>

00:53.580 --> 00:56.080
<b>But... I'm not sure it's the right choice.</b>

00:56.080 --> 00:56.710
<b>Huh?</b>

00:57.170 --> 01:02.130
<b>I mean, not everything will work out just because
you're chasing after an ideal. Even I agree with that.</b>

01:03.380 --> 01:05.580
<b>Honestly, there probably is no right answer.</b>

01:05.960 --> 01:09.290
<b>What really matters is how much effort
you've put into achieving your dreams...</b>

01:11.080 --> 01:13.790
<b>And after you ultimately come short of your ideals,</b>

01:14.080 --> 01:15.960
<b>what you've managed to leave behind.</b>

01:20.670 --> 01:23.960
<b>Even someone as upright, virtuous,
wise, and perfect as I am</b>

01:23.960 --> 01:25.830
<b>can't say more than that!</b>

01:27.130 --> 01:29.420
<b>In any case, ideals are important to have!</b>

01:32.500 --> 01:34.290
<b>Because if we didn't strive for them,</b>

01:34.290 --> 01:38.130
<b>we would end up obtaining less from
the compromises that we all have to make.</b>

01:38.790 --> 01:41.880
<b>So there's good reason for you to aspire to your ideals.</b>

01:42.250 --> 01:43.960
<b>That's what I believe, anyway.</b>

01:45.130 --> 01:48.540
<b>But what happens if someone manages
to make their ideals a reality?</b>

01:49.750 --> 01:50.750
<b>Isn't that obvious?</b>

01:52.420 --> 01:53.790
<b>Those are the people who...</b>

01:55.130 --> 01:56.750
<b>we call heroes!</b>

02:08.710 --> 02:12.630
<b>Is it Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?  IV</b>

03:28.000 --> 03:32.250
<b>Desperate</b>

03:28.000 --> 03:32.250
<b>Dungeon Do-or-Die Time</b>

03:44.540 --> 03:45.710
<b>What is happening...?</b>

03:46.250 --> 03:47.170
<b>Haruhime.</b>

03:48.920 --> 03:50.210
<b>We came to rescue you!</b>

03:51.500 --> 03:53.250
<b>Lady Wiene?</b>

03:53.460 --> 03:54.170
<b>Yep!</b>

03:59.420 --> 04:01.080
<b>I've missed you, Haruhime!</b>

04:01.540 --> 04:03.790
<b>Same here! Of course!</b>

04:04.040 --> 04:06.330
<b>Guess what? I didn't cry at all!</b>

04:06.580 --> 04:09.420
<b>I held it in this whole time because
I didn't want you guys to worry...</b>

04:13.170 --> 04:16.380
<b>But now... I can't stop my tears...</b>

04:30.250 --> 04:31.380
<b>You guys...</b>

04:39.670 --> 04:43.960
<b>I remember that monster.
From back on Daedalus Street that one time...</b>

04:44.170 --> 04:45.750
<b>What is going on?</b>

04:45.750 --> 04:47.130
<b>W-well, I'm just guessing...</b>

04:47.420 --> 04:54.710
<b>But they must be Irregulars in the dungeon. You know,
it's one of those... "miracle of mother nature" type things!</b>

04:56.540 --> 04:57.670
<b>What the meow?</b>

04:58.130 --> 05:00.540
<b>This is all throwing me fur a loop!</b>

05:02.130 --> 05:03.330
<b>It's Lady Tsubaki!</b>

05:03.960 --> 05:06.420
<b>That means Goddess Hestia came through for us!</b>

05:07.460 --> 05:10.250
<b>Well, we managed to find Mr. Cranel's friends...</b>

05:11.040 --> 05:13.790
<b>I'm purrplexed why all these
monsters fighting each other!</b>

05:15.420 --> 05:18.420
<b>We need your help to defeat the monsters
that aren't armed! Please and thanks!</b>

05:18.710 --> 05:21.830
<b>Huh? I guess this is no time tabby confused...</b>

05:22.210 --> 05:24.380
<b>We'll just follow orders and give you some suppawt!</b>

05:32.500 --> 05:33.330
<b>Incredible!</b>

05:39.880 --> 05:40.750
<b>There you are, Welly!</b>

05:41.000 --> 05:43.710
<b>Tsubaki! What are you doing here?</b>

05:44.170 --> 05:45.500
<b>That magic sword...</b>

05:55.880 --> 05:58.830
<b>Well, I'll be damned! You cocky little greenhorn!</b>

05:59.080 --> 06:01.420
<b>I can tell you were shooting
beyond the stars with that one!</b>

06:01.750 --> 06:06.290
<b>Which is a laugh since you have no idea how
sublime the blades forged by true masters can be!</b>

06:06.750 --> 06:08.790
<b>It's honestly offensive!</b>

06:08.790 --> 06:10.710
<b>But damn if it ain't exciting!</b>

06:11.880 --> 06:14.750
<b>Congratulations, Welf Crozzo.</b>

06:15.250 --> 06:17.500
<b>And welcome to hell.</b>

06:17.880 --> 06:19.460
<b>Heh. Happy to be here.</b>

06:20.080 --> 06:21.380
<b>I'm in a good mood.</b>

06:21.920 --> 06:23.670
<b>I'll do you a solid and take care of the rest.</b>

06:24.500 --> 06:25.540
<b>Wait, Tsubaki!</b>

06:25.540 --> 06:26.670
<b>Those monsters are-</b>

06:26.670 --> 06:28.210
<b>Yeah, I know!</b>

06:34.580 --> 06:35.540
<b>Rido!</b>

06:36.040 --> 06:37.460
<b>Ridooooo!</b>

06:38.750 --> 06:39.630
<b>Marie!</b>

06:41.380 --> 06:42.920
<b>What are you doing out here?!</b>

06:42.920 --> 06:44.380
<b>Rido! Bell's in trouble!</b>

06:44.380 --> 06:45.000
<b>Huh?</b>

06:45.380 --> 06:48.000
<b>Bell fell! He went down even lower!</b>

06:48.290 --> 06:49.380
<b>My man Bell?!</b>

06:49.380 --> 06:51.960
<b>Wait a sec, Marie. You actually saw Bell?</b>

07:12.250 --> 07:16.000
<b>What's their purroblem?!
There are still monsters left to beat!</b>

07:17.750 --> 07:21.670
<b>Oh fur crying out loud! I can't make heads or tails of this!</b>

07:22.170 --> 07:23.420
<b>What did Master Rido say?</b>

07:23.790 --> 07:29.920
<b>He said that Mr. Bell and an Elf adventurer were attacked
by a monster and then taken down below.</b>

07:30.830 --> 07:34.790
<b>Also, that an even bigger monster
went chasing after them.</b>

07:35.500 --> 07:37.250
<b>Do you know what floor Master Bell is on?</b>

07:37.540 --> 07:38.500
<b>I'm afraid not.</b>

07:38.920 --> 07:39.790
<b>However...</b>

07:40.790 --> 07:45.250
<b>Given what we know, Master Ouranos suspects that
they might have gone as far as the Deep Floors.</b>

07:46.170 --> 07:47.420
<b>The Deep Floors...</b>

07:48.290 --> 07:50.460
<b>One last thing, Rido had a message for you.</b>

07:51.290 --> 07:54.040
<b>"You can join us if you want. We'll carve a path for you."</b>

07:56.500 --> 07:57.710
<b>Mewph!</b>

07:59.750 --> 08:01.790
<b>All those monsters are hisstory now.</b>

08:01.790 --> 08:02.460
<b>Lady Anya!</b>

08:02.460 --> 08:03.330
<b>Uh, can I help mew?</b>

08:03.710 --> 08:04.920
<b>What level are you right now?</b>

08:05.250 --> 08:07.960
<b>Wh-why is that of any impawtance?</b>

08:08.420 --> 08:09.880
<b>Where is Ryu?</b>

08:09.880 --> 08:11.080
<b>Never mind that!</b>

08:11.460 --> 08:13.040
<b>Just answer the question!</b>

08:13.040 --> 08:14.330
<b>Oh fur the love of...</b>

08:14.880 --> 08:17.080
<b>I'm level 4, meokay?</b>

08:17.080 --> 08:18.880
<b>What about Lady Chloe and Lady Lunor?</b>

08:20.750 --> 08:23.460
<b>W-we're all the same level as Ryu, jeez!</b>

08:24.170 --> 08:25.420
<b>Level 4!</b>

08:25.880 --> 08:26.920
<b>Hey everybody!</b>

08:27.330 --> 08:29.630
<b>We're leaving the Water Capital and forging on ahead!</b>

08:30.000 --> 08:35.460
<b>It's highly likely that both Master Bell and Lady Ryu
were dragged down to a lower floor by a monster.</b>

08:35.830 --> 08:40.040
<b>So we're going to reform our party with everyone here
and then head for the safety point below.</b>

08:40.630 --> 08:43.250
<b>Then we'll set out to rescue Master Bell from there!</b>

08:43.500 --> 08:44.920
<b>Hold on a minute!</b>

08:45.130 --> 08:49.250
<b>We don't have any proof that Rabbit Foot was
dragged anywhere! Or even that he's alive!</b>

08:49.670 --> 08:51.750
<b>No objections will be heard, period!</b>

08:52.000 --> 08:52.880
<b>What?!</b>

08:53.250 --> 08:57.000
<b>You just pulled that plan out of your butt!
There's no way it'll work!</b>

08:57.330 --> 09:00.670
<b>The odds of success don't matter! We have to do this!</b>

09:03.330 --> 09:06.210
<b>This is kitten pretty confusing, but...</b>

09:06.630 --> 09:10.790
<b>If you're so sure that Ryu is on a lower floor,
then we're going with mew!</b>

09:11.210 --> 09:16.880
<b>Hold on, the dungeon just gets harder the deeper
we go, right? I'm tired enough as it is, jeez.</b>

09:17.080 --> 09:20.710
<b>I say it's not worth coopurrating if
we don't get some kind of bonus out of it.</b>

09:22.630 --> 09:24.630
<b>Aw why not, we're all in the same boat!</b>

09:24.920 --> 09:27.790
<b>Th-there's no way in hell that
I'm tagging along with you gu-</b>

09:28.000 --> 09:30.500
<b>Where do you think you're going, level 3?</b>

09:30.960 --> 09:34.130
<b>Because you're gonna work your ass off for us
until you're too exhausted to move.</b>

09:35.040 --> 09:36.580
<b>Gimme a friggin' break!</b>

09:36.880 --> 09:41.500
<b>Those monsters with weapons...
I get the feeling they were here to save us.</b>

09:41.920 --> 09:44.000
<b>I have no clue what's going on.</b>

09:44.290 --> 09:46.630
<b>You better have a good explanation later, blacksmith!</b>

09:46.960 --> 09:47.790
<b>That might be tough.</b>

09:48.380 --> 09:50.460
<b>Not sure I know how to explain this very well myself.</b>

09:53.830 --> 09:55.830
<b>Come on, Daphne. Let's go!</b>

09:56.580 --> 09:59.380
<b>Oh whatever! I'll go, dammit!</b>

09:59.380 --> 10:02.000
<b>It wouldn't make sense to give up at this point anyway!</b>

10:05.420 --> 10:08.170
<b>Let's get going, Haruhime. We gotta save Bell!</b>

10:08.540 --> 10:10.630
<b>Right! As you say, Lady Wiene!</b>

10:21.040 --> 10:22.130
<b>Let's move!</b>

10:42.710 --> 10:45.210
<b>He hasn't hit a limit after everything we've been through?</b>

10:46.040 --> 10:47.420
<b>He's improving little by little.</b>

10:48.790 --> 10:49.540
<b>No...</b>

10:50.750 --> 10:51.670
<b>by leaps and bounds!</b>

10:54.290 --> 10:56.080
<b>Miss Ryu gave me a lot of good advice.</b>

10:56.830 --> 10:58.210
<b>Use the surroundings to my advantage.</b>

10:58.670 --> 10:59.790
<b>Keep my right arm steady.</b>

11:00.210 --> 11:02.330
<b>Pay attention to the enemy's
movements and predict them!</b>

11:12.750 --> 11:14.130
<b>Miss Ais once told me...</b>

11:14.920 --> 11:18.250
<b>"Landing the final blow is a step away
from one's own demise."</b>

11:28.790 --> 11:29.750
<b>He can see right through them.</b>

11:30.630 --> 11:34.630
<b>I bait the monsters into trying to land
a final blow while I'm weak, then kill them.</b>

11:35.500 --> 11:37.830
<b>The advice I got from Miss Ryu
and Miss Ais are connected!</b>

11:40.210 --> 11:42.830
<b>He knows that death awaits unless he gets stronger.</b>

11:44.330 --> 11:49.830
<b>Is it the extreme pressure of being in the Deep Floors
that's actually pushing him to new heights?</b>

12:00.630 --> 12:01.540
<b>Miss Ryu!</b>

12:02.170 --> 12:04.040
<b>Stay focused on the enemy in front of you!</b>

12:04.500 --> 12:06.330
<b>Getting distracted will cost you your life!</b>

12:06.880 --> 12:07.500
<b>Right!</b>

12:15.500 --> 12:17.500
<b>I can't afford to be a hindrance to him.</b>

12:18.380 --> 12:20.130
<b>I'll also have to fight.</b>

12:37.170 --> 12:39.210
<b>Kaguya, I'm borrowing one of your moves.</b>

12:44.380 --> 12:49.380
<b>I'm sure that Kaguya would laugh if she saw me now.
But I'll do whatever it takes to buy more time.</b>

12:49.880 --> 12:52.420
<b>Just long enough for Mr. Cranel to finish up his fight!</b>

12:57.290 --> 12:58.170
<b>A Barbarian?!</b>

13:55.750 --> 13:56.630
<b>Mr. Cranel!</b>

14:06.040 --> 14:07.420
<b>Let's rest for now.</b>

14:11.710 --> 14:13.380
<b>"Juggernaut"?</b>

14:13.920 --> 14:15.750
<b>So that's the name of that monster?</b>

14:16.250 --> 14:18.710
<b>Yes. That's what I heard.</b>

14:19.290 --> 14:21.830
<b>Although I didn't learn that until everything was over.</b>

14:22.710 --> 14:25.000
<b>It was after Syr saved me.</b>

14:25.670 --> 14:29.420
<b>All of a sudden, this mysterious
figure clad in black spoke to me.</b>

14:30.040 --> 14:31.540
<b>I believe it was a Mage.</b>

14:32.170 --> 14:34.500
<b>I'm guessing that was Mr. Fels...</b>

14:45.630 --> 14:46.880
<b>Gale Wind.</b>

14:52.130 --> 14:57.000
<b>All information related to the Juggernaut that
you know must be kept strictly confidential.</b>

14:57.920 --> 15:02.170
<b>Follow these terms and we are willing to leave you alone.</b>

15:02.920 --> 15:06.670
<b>Out of respect for your praiseworthy service
as a member of the Astrea Familia,</b>

15:07.630 --> 15:09.290
<b>you shall not be held accountable.</b>

15:19.290 --> 15:22.290
<b>Assuming that mage was part of the Guild's private army,</b>

15:22.880 --> 15:26.170
<b>it means that the Guild was aware
of that monster's existence.</b>

15:26.540 --> 15:27.830
<b>That's the logical conclusion.</b>

15:29.000 --> 15:30.210
<b>The Juggernaut...</b>

15:37.170 --> 15:40.130
<b>Miss Ryu. Can you tell me what happened?</b>

15:41.040 --> 15:42.670
<b>With you and the Juggernaut?</b>

15:49.420 --> 15:50.290
<b>Mr. Cranel.</b>

15:52.210 --> 15:53.040
<b>We have company.</b>

16:51.710 --> 16:52.540
<b>Miss Ryu!</b>

16:53.250 --> 16:54.000
<b>Over there.</b>

16:57.710 --> 16:58.790
<b>Behind us, too.</b>

17:26.580 --> 17:29.960
<b>We can't even aim for their magic stones
when they're totally on the defensive like this!</b>

17:33.790 --> 17:36.080
<b>We need to find a way to get through and escape!</b>

17:36.580 --> 17:37.960
<b>Otherwise we'll be overwhelmed!</b>

17:40.380 --> 17:41.330
<b>A Peluda!</b>

17:44.210 --> 17:46.040
<b>Look out! Those needles are poisonous!</b>

18:19.420 --> 18:20.710
<b>Did that get all of them?</b>

18:21.170 --> 18:23.420
<b>It took out the monsters closest to us, at least...</b>

18:36.290 --> 18:37.130
<b>Mr. Cranel!</b>

19:09.500 --> 19:10.460
<b>No way...</b>

19:26.040 --> 19:28.330
<b>Mr. Cranel, is that what I think it is?</b>

19:30.130 --> 19:31.790
<b>It's a Unicorn Horn.</b>

19:33.040 --> 19:36.040
<b>The item that's most effective in counteracting poison...</b>

19:37.080 --> 19:39.540
<b>I can't believe someone made a weapon from it.</b>

19:40.710 --> 19:43.040
<b>Welf's knife just saved my butt.</b>

19:44.000 --> 19:45.040
<b>Mr. Cranel.</b>

19:46.210 --> 19:47.380
<b>Let's get you patched up.</b>

19:52.380 --> 19:54.790
<b>There goes the last potion we had on hand.</b>

19:55.670 --> 19:58.130
<b>We need to find the normal route and get out of here fast.</b>

19:59.330 --> 20:04.130
<b>The only option we have left is this one path that those
adventurers partially mapped out.</b>

20:04.750 --> 20:08.500
<b>The problem is, we don't know what made them turn
back.</b>

20:09.080 --> 20:10.880
<b>Was it because they got a dose of the Peluda's poison?</b>

20:15.460 --> 20:18.540
<b>But they would've been fighting
against the clock in that case.</b>

20:19.250 --> 20:21.080
<b>I find it hard to believe they'd backtrack.</b>

20:21.790 --> 20:23.420
<b>In that situation, I would press on ahead.</b>

20:24.250 --> 20:30.290
<b>Which means... maybe there was something on the path
ahead that gave them no choice but to give up.</b>

20:31.040 --> 20:32.710
<b>Miss Ryu? What's our next move?</b>

20:33.710 --> 20:36.080
<b>We're going to follow the route written on this map.</b>

20:51.500 --> 20:53.790
<b>The path is turning more and more into an uphill climb.</b>

20:54.380 --> 20:55.830
<b>Is your leg doing okay?</b>

20:56.500 --> 20:57.460
<b>It's fine.</b>

20:58.580 --> 21:00.540
<b>This terrain... I recognize it!</b>

21:09.130 --> 21:10.210
<b>I don't believe it.</b>

21:10.580 --> 21:12.080
<b>What's wrong, Miss Ryu?</b>

21:12.710 --> 21:15.460
<b>Well, I just figured out exactly where we are.</b>

21:21.960 --> 21:27.670
<b>If we climb these stairs and get past the area up ahead,
then we will find the normal route.</b>

21:27.920 --> 21:29.790
<b>Really?! Then let's go!</b>

22:03.130 --> 22:04.460
<b>The Colosseum.</b>

23:35.000 --> 23:40.000
<b>Next Time</b>

23:35.000 --> 23:40.000
<b>Colosseum</b>

23:35.000 --> 23:40.000
<b>Combat Arena</b>

23:36.290 --> 23:38.290
<b>Next time: "Colosseum".</b>
